Subject: [PATCH] Merge the cross-species figures and move three figures to the
 supplement

Following Koen's comments: Figures 5 and 6 become Figure 4 (surfaces,
gradient space and profiles at locations A-C), and the k-means check and
the cross-species permutation tests move to Supplementary Figures S5, S9
and S10. Old S5-S7 become S6-S8. All other figures are pixel-identical.

